WEBVTT

00:04:25.542 --> 00:04:30.833
Despite all the challenges and hurdles
I faced throughout this process, I won.

00:04:31.333 --> 00:04:37.434
(Applause)

00:04:37.458 --> 00:04:40.750
And I served in the public
office for six years.

00:04:42.375 --> 00:04:44.351
But unfortunately,

00:04:44.375 --> 00:04:46.601
we women, elected women,

00:04:46.625 --> 00:04:50.542
we were not allowed to sit in the council
together with all the members

00:04:52.792 --> 00:04:54.583
and to take part in the proceedings.

00:04:56.083 --> 00:04:59.393
We had to sit in a separate,
ladies-only room,

00:04:59.417 --> 00:05:01.750
not even aware what
was happening in the council.